 "note": "Mixed two-column page (filename tag ignored): custodians, groundskeeping/maintenance, cafeteria personnel. Elementary School / Elementary Annex -> unknown (not in vocabulary). Groundsman and maintenance mechanic and School Lunch Supervisor (office Senior High School) -> district-wide. Cafeteria columns are interleaved by Textract: left column HIGH SCHOOL CAFETERIA (Solovei, Beaulac, Blanchard, Catorio, Davis, Ferguson, Jokinen, Kokk, Lusco), right column MIDDLE SCHOOL CAFETERIA (Forest, Cook, Cote, Crespin, Doucette, Ritari, Thibodeau); deduced from the replacement notes (Beaulac transferred back to High School replacing Solovei; Forest became Middle School cook/manager replacing Beaulac). Winchester (Baker, line 18) replaced Beaulac as High School baker -> high (inferred). Thibault (line 58) placed with the Elementary School cafeteria (UNCERTAIN: could be the left column, High School). Staff who retired/resigned/took leave during the year (LeBlanc, Solovei, Jokinen, Deming) are still printed in the listing, kept as entries. Mrs. dropped.  Integration pass, 31 Oct 2026: school bus contractors, drivers and volunteers moved from entries to ignored (not school staff; every 1971-1980 page treated alike), and `middle` written `turkey-hill` -- the 1972 and 1974 listings print the building as `Turkey Hill Middle School (Grades 5-7)`, the town's one middle school."
